In the comparison between the 5xFAD and WT both treated with placebo mice group, 209 significantly dys-regulated proteins found, with 127 proteins up-regulated and 82 proteins down-regulated in the 5xFAD group. The volcano plot indicated that Aβ-induced proteins like App, Apoe, Hexb, Bace1, Ncstn were significantly up-regulated in the 5xFAD mice (Fig.
7a
, Supplementary Table
S1
) [
92
–
94
].
